# VROO UI/UX
- Mobile-first and usable on desktop.
- Avoid horizontal overflow.
- All primary actions must have visible feedback and disabled/loading/error states.
- Preserve chat history context and clearly distinguish participants.
- Floating panels opened by `+` should be draggable where technically appropriate, keyboard accessible, and remain within viewport.
- My Page must use clear visual sections, consistent spacing, and a restrained premium automotive visual language.
- Never use mock UI as completed functionality.
